      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Summerland%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Perched on coastal bluffs, Summerland’s Lookout Park offers sweeping ocean views that have drawn surfers, artists, and hippies.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
